## Vehicle Hardpoint Printer Tooltips
## These ent- entries provide .printer-desc attributes shown in the hardpoint printer UI.
## Entries without a root message preserve the YAML entity name in-world.

## Tank - Primary Weapons
# ent-VehicleTankLTBCannon
#   .printer-desc = A light cannon system for the tank primary hardpoint.
#       Loads [color=goldenrod]LTB cannon shells[/color].
ent-VehicleTankLTAAAPMinigun = LTAAAP Minigun
    .printer-desc = A rapid anti-air minigun weapons system.
        Loads [color=goldenrod]LTAA-[color=SeaGreen]AP[/color][/color] rounds.
ent-VehicleTankAceAutocannon = ACE Autocannon
    .printer-desc = A precise long range autocannon system.
        Loads [color=goldenrod]20mm ACE magazines[/color].
ent-VehicleTankDragonFlamer = DRGN Flamer
    .printer-desc = A powerful high-combustion flamer system.
        Loads [color=goldenrod]DRGN napalm tanks[/color].

## Tank - Secondary Weapons
ent-VehicleTankFlamer = Tank Flamer
    .printer-desc = A modified flamer designed to be mounted on a hardpoint.
        Refilled with [color=goldenrod]napalm tanks.[/color].
ent-VehicleTankGrenadeLauncher = Tank Grenade Launcher
    .printer-desc = A 10 round grenade launcher designed to be mounted on a hardpoint.
        Loads [color=goldenrod]30mm HEDP Grenades[/color].
ent-VehicleTankTowLauncher = Tank TOW Launcher
    .printer-desc = A TOW anti-armor launcher designed to be mounted on a hardpoint.
        Loads [color=goldenrod]rocket launcher ammo boxes[/color].
ent-VehicleTankM56Cupola = M56 Cupola
    .printer-desc = A heavily modified smartgun for tanks.
        Loads [color=goldenrod]cupola ammo boxes[/color].
ent-VehicleTankRERE700 = RE-RE700 Cupola
    .printer-desc = A heavily modified smartgun for tanks.
        Loads [color=goldenrod]cupola ammo boxes[/color].

## Tank - Armor
ent-VehicleTankArmorBallistic = Ballistic Armor Plating
    .printer-desc = Increases tank resistance to [color=yellow]ballistic[/color] damage.
ent-VehicleTankArmorConcussive = Concussive Armor Plating
    .printer-desc = Increases tank resistance to [color=orange]blunt[/color] and [color=red]explosive[/color] damage.
ent-VehicleTankArmorCaustic = Caustic Armor Plating
    .printer-desc = Increases tank resistance to [color=green]acid[/color] damage.
ent-VehicleTankArmorPaladin = Paladin Armor Plating
    .printer-desc = Increases tank resistance to [color=orange]blunt[/color], [color=red]explosive[/color], and [color=green]acid[/color] damage.
ent-VehicleTankSnowplow = Tank Snowplow
    .printer-desc = A reinforced plow for the tank armor hardpoint. Allows the tank to push objects.

## Tank - Support
ent-VehicleTankWarningArray = Integrated Weapons Sensor Array
    .printer-desc = Boosts the accuracy and fire rate of all onboard weapons.
ent-VehicleTankOverdriveEnhancer = Overdrive Enhancer
    .printer-desc = Increases tank movement speed.
ent-VehicleTankRocketLauncher = Smoke Launcher
    .printer-desc = Launches smoke grenades in all directions.
        Loads [color=goldenrod]grenade launcher ammo boxes[/color].
ent-VehicleTankFlareModule = Flare Module
    .printer-desc = Launches flares in all directions.
        Loads [color=goldenrod]standard flares[/color].
ent-VehicleTankArtilleryModule = Artillery Module
    .printer-desc = Provides a long-range gunnery view for the tank operator.

## Tank - Treads
ent-VehicleTankTreads = Tank Treads
    .printer-desc = Standard heavy duty tank treads.
ent-VehicleTankReinforcedTreads = Reinforced Tank Treads
    .printer-desc = Heavier treads with better durability and [color=green]acid[/color] resistance at the cost of acceleration.

## Humvee
