    .printer-desc = A fixed IFF rotary cannon for the humvee turret.
        Loads [color=goldenrod]RE rotary cannon ammo boxes[/color].
ent-VehicleHumveeARCCannon = ARC Cannon
    .printer-desc = A burst-fire cannon configured for ARC humvee turrets.
        Loads [color=goldenrod]RE rotary cannon ammo boxes[/color].
ent-VehicleHumveeLauncher = Humvee Launcher
    .printer-desc = A grenade launcher for the humvee turret.
        Loads [color=goldenrod]grenade launcher ammo boxes[/color].
ent-VehicleHumveeSnowplow = Humvee Snowplow
    .printer-desc = A reinforced plow for the front of the humvee.
ent-VehicleHumveeOverlight = Humvee Overlight
    .printer-desc = Doubles the range of the humvee's spotlight.
ent-VehicleHumveeHatch = Humvee Hatch
    .printer-desc = A hatch assembly for the roof of the humvee.
ent-VehicleHumveeWheel = Humvee Wheel
    .printer-desc = A reinforced humvee wheel.

